(2329, 'La nueva era de las casas prefabricadas de lujo en España: 6 proyectos que llevan la arquitectura industrializada a otro nivel', 'La arquitectura industrializada no está reñida con el diseño y la calidad. Así lo confirman estos 6 proyectos firmados por destacados estudios', '<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:Outfit, serif;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:300;letter-spacing:-0.1px;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Esta vivienda es un proyecto de Niu Houses by Fran Silvestre, uno de cuyos modelos proyectado con este sistema de construcción industrializada ha sido galardonado con un Delta de bronce en los premios ADI-FAD. Esta casa unifamiliar sigue el esquema clásico de distribución y se organiza en dos plantas: la baja destinada a zona de día y la superior al programa de noche.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(62,62,62);font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:&quot;Noto Serif SC&quot;, serif;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.1px;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">En arquitectura la denominación </span></span><strong style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(62, 62, 62);font-family:&quot;Noto Serif SC&quot;, serif;font-size:18px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;letter-spacing:-0.1px;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">\'casa prefabricada\' </strong><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(62,62,62);font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:&quot;Noto Serif SC&quot;, serif;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.1px;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">hace tiempo que dejó atrás el tono peyorativo. En la actualidad, este </span></span><strong style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(62, 62, 62);font-family:&quot;Noto Serif SC&quot;, serif;font-size:18px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;letter-spacing:-0.1px;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">tipo de construcción más sostenible, rápida, de bajo impacto ambiental y altamente tecnológica</strong><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(62,62,62);font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:&quot;Noto Serif SC&quot;, serif;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.1px;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">&nbsp;supone la vanguardia en edificación. Algunos pronostican que construir en ladrillo será una rareza y un despilfarro, el hecho es que la arquitectura prefabricada, la que&nbsp;</span></span><strong style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(62, 62, 62);font-family:&quot;Noto Serif SC&quot;, serif;font-size:18px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;letter-spacing:-0.1px;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">se construye fuera del terreno a edificar,&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(62,62,62);font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:&quot;Noto Serif SC&quot;, serif;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.1px;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">es una alternativa a la construcción tradicional.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(62,62,62);font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:&quot;Noto Serif SC&quot;, serif;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.1px;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">No obstante, hay que remontarse al año 2008</span></span><strong style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(62, 62, 62);font-family:&quot;Noto Serif SC&quot;, serif;font-size:18px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;letter-spacing:-0.1px;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(62,62,62);font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:&quot;Noto Serif SC&quot;, serif;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.1px;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">para recordar la </span></span><strong style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(62, 62, 62);font-family:&quot;Noto Serif SC&quot;, serif;font-size:18px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;letter-spacing:-0.1px;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Casa Hemeroscopium</strong><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(62,62,62);font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:&quot;Noto Serif SC&quot;, serif;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.1px;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;wido